                "headline": "Special Marine Warning issued November 25 at 7:43AM EST until November 25 at 8:45AM EST by NWS Melbourne FL",
                "description": "SMWMLB\n\nThe National Weather Service in Melbourne has issued a\n\n* Special Marine Warning for...\nSebastian Inlet to Jupiter Inlet 20-60 nm...\n\n* Until 845 AM EST.\n\n* At 743 AM EST, a shower capable of producing waterspouts was\nlocated 35 nm east of Saint Lucie Nuclear Power Plant, moving north\nat 15 knots.\n\nHAZARD...Waterspouts and wind gusts 34 knots or greater.\n\nSOURCE...Radar.\n\nIMPACT...Waterspouts can create locally hazardous seas. Make sure\nall on board are wearing life jackets. Expect wind gusts\nin excess of 34 knots, suddenly higher waves, lightning\nand heavy downpours. Make sure all on board are wearing\nlife jackets. Return to safe harbor if possible.\n\n* The shower will remain over mainly open waters.",
